                                "sense_id": "0ded339e-7fe4-3fe9-82f4-1009e876e2cd",
                                "text": "With his huge, coarse tone and urgent phrasing Brotzmann sounds like he could dominate any group using anything he plays, which includes saxophones, clarinets, and the tarogato, an eastern European reed instrument."
